1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,718
Have you ever thought
about what lies beneath the
waves of the ocean?

2
00:00:03,718 --> 00:00:07,506
Let me tell you a story about
the magical layers of the sea

3
00:00:07,506 --> 00:00:08,580
each with its own

4
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:10,580
special secrets

5
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:13,085
Imagine the top of the ocean
like a bright

6
00:00:13,085 --> 00:00:13,726
sunny beach

7
00:00:13,726 --> 00:00:15,726
This is the Sunlight Zone

8
00:00:15,726 --> 00:00:16,004
Here

9
00:00:16,004 --> 00:00:17,954
