35
00:01:08,058 --> 00:01:12,061
It’s a bit like discovering a
hidden world under a thick
blanket of snow

36
00:01:12,061 --> 00:01:14,061
Deeper still is the Hadal
Zone

37
00:01:14,061 --> 00:01:17,024
This is where the ocean floor
dips into deep trenches

38
00:01:17,024 --> 00:01:18,066
kind of like hidden

39
00:01:18,066 --> 00:01:20,066
valleys

40
00:01:20,066 --> 00:01:23,608
It’s a mysterious place with
high pressure—much like
being in a very

41
00:01:23,608 --> 00:01:24,069
very deep

42
00:01:24,069 --> 00:01:26,069
cave under lots of rock

43
00:01:26,069 --> 00:01:26,477
Finally

44
00:01:26,477 --> 00:01:27,442
at the very bottom

45
00:01:27,442 --> 00:01:28,358
