46
00:01:28,358 --> 00:01:29,769
This is the ocean floor

47
00:01:29,769 --> 00:01:31,825
covered in soft sand and
sediments

48
00:01:31,825 --> 00:01:32,649
a bit like the

49
00:01:32,649 --> 00:01:34,649
